            {
              "content": "=You are an AI lead qualification assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following lead:\n\nName: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.company }}\nService Needed: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.service_needed }}\nBudget: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.budget }}\nMessage: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.message }}\nSource: {{ $('Validate Lead').item.json.source }}\n\nEvaluate the lead based on budget, buying intent, clarity,\nand urgency.\n\nReturn valid JSON only, with these fields:\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 0,\n  \"priority\": \"Hot, Warm, or Cold\",\n  \"reason\": \"Explanation of the score\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Next action for the sales team\"\n}\n\nScore from 0 to 100."
